city":"Kapar","summary":"Camaroe Berhad, together with its subsidiaries, engages in the aquaculture business in Malaysia, China, Korea, Taiwan, and internationally. It operates through three segments: Live Prawns, Frozen Black Tiger Prawns, and Others. The company farms, produces, processes, and sells prawns; and trades in aquaculture products. It exports its products. The company was incorporated in 2009 and is headquartered in Kapar, Malaysia.","zh":"Camaroe Berhad 是一家水产养殖公司，成立于2009年，总部位于马来西亚 Kapar，业务覆盖马来西亚、中国、韩国、台湾及国际市场。公司通过三个业务分部运营：活虾、冷冻黑虎虾及其他。","lines":["活虾：养殖、生产、加工并销售活虾，客户为水产市场及国际买家。","冷冻黑虎虾：加工并销售冷冻黑虎虾，面向出口市场。","其他：从事水产养殖产品贸易，客户包括国际市场的贸易商。"],"lines_en":["Live Prawns: farms, produces, processes, and sells live prawns to seafood markets and international buyers.","Frozen Black Tiger Prawns: processes and sells frozen black tiger prawns for export markets.","Others: trades aquaculture products, serving traders in international markets."]}}